<title>USA: Alaska Student Loan $75 mln repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>Alaska Student Loan $75 mln repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc. said Tuesday it repriced Alaska Student Loan Corporation $75 million bond deal, cutting the top yield in 2014 to 5.75 percent from 5.80 percent and lowering several yields in other maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>ALASKA STUDENT LOAN CORPORATION</p>
<p>RE: $75,000,000*</p>
<p>STUDENT LOAN REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>1997 SERIES A</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE REPRICING OF THE ISSUE.</p>
<p>WE WILL ASSUME ALL ORDERS ARE GOOD AT THE NEW LEVELS UNLESS WE</p>
<p>HEAR FROM YOU BY 2:15PM TODAY.</p>
<p>			SUBJECT TO ALTERNATIVE MINIMUM TAX</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>	   UNDERLYING A	     UNDERLYING A</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p>DATED: 06/01/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
<p>07/01/2003		2,000M    5.00  %</p>
<p>07/01/2004		4,000M    5.10  %</p>
<p>07/01/2005		9,000M    5.15  %</p>
<p>07/01/2006		5,000M    5.20  %</p>
<p>07/01/2007		6,000M    5.25  %</p>
<p>07/01/2008		6,000M    5.35  %</p>
<p>07/01/2009		6,000M    5.45  %</p>
<p>07/01/2010		7,000M    5.55  %</p>
<p>07/01/2011		7,000M    5.60  %</p>
<p>07/01/2012		7,000M    5.65  %</p>
<p>07/01/2013		8,000M    5.70  %</p>
<p>07/01/2014		8,000M    5.75  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES:</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, June 12, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on June 18, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>Prudential Securities Incorporated</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
